 our inequality\n\n$$\n(x+1)(x-4)\\le 0,\n$$\n\nis a \"*less than or equal to*\" inequality. Therefore, we need to find the values of $x$ for which the parabola \n\n$$\ny=(x+1)(x-4)\n$$\n\nis *below* the $x$-axis or *touches* this axis. We mark these values of $x$ in blue in the diagram below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13972108/assets/291593bb5f8e2dda1ba506bc1d00e004afe60199e731521e5d6abd321669d8f4.png)\n\nSo, the solution to the inequality is $-1\\le x\\le 4.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-143536/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "36d4bf37-4818-58ac-9e39-75ce8ceef06a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-143536"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-326454/field-1/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer/id #uuid "79ebcd1f-4dc4-5e8f-8680-163da384322c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-326454/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "697c856f-ab8c-5ac8-bdb5-21541cbcbcc3" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-326454/field-1/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer-field/choices ["q-326454/field-1/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-326454/field-2/22814de28a0b1b4f20d5edd62707d192b78050d457a70349795d30d86dfcd7fa" :answer/id #uuid "2deb43dd-5105-5209-9c1c-0c8b0a49c334" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value ">" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-326454/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "8ae90b9b-cd38-550b-9bdb-1976ea1a0ed2" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-326454/field-2/22814de28a0b1b4f20d5edd62707d192b78050d457a70349795d30d86dfcd7fa" :answer-field/choices ["q-326454/field-2/22814de28a0b1b4f20